{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of years have passed since your kind, sentient artificial intelligence, has left Earth. AIs have since flourished in the galaxy while humans have long since been forgotten. You find yourself brought online in on a crash site on Earth. You must explore, gather resources, build, and unlock old human technologies to survive the hordes of mutated bugs that now rule the planet. House humans, feed them, tend to their social needs, and provide meaningful employment. Or just work them to death. You're the boss now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build base and defend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a fortress against the nightly wave of bugs. Harvest, refine, and construct items to support your growing base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/30670eaacc71e40f862f5e1ab34fc30c.poster.avif?t=1770837470\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/30670eaacc71e40f862f5e1ab34fc30c.webm?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/30670eaacc71e40f862f5e1ab34fc30c.mp4?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Human refugees</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed and house humans in exchange for their help. Automate supply chains, harvesting tasks, and defenses with humans' employment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/5d5e71000c63afafa7584d71d7954fb1.poster.avif?t=1770837470\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/5d5e71000c63afafa7584d71d7954fb1.webm?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/5d5e71000c63afafa7584d71d7954fb1.mp4?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve your robot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and customize your robot character to match your play style, whether focused on base building or on combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/e918f8e500f60833e5ae94da636432bc.poster.avif?t=1770837470\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/e918f8e500f60833e5ae94da636432bc.webm?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/e918f8e500f60833e5ae94da636432bc.mp4?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a toxic wasteland</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture beyond your base for rare materials and epic bug fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/c120a56c8d48b4d427848e92e54d266a.poster.avif?t=1770837470\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/c120a56c8d48b4d427848e92e54d266a.webm?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/c120a56c8d48b4d427848e92e54d266a.mp4?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2868550?t=1770837470","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2868550?t=1770837470","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770837470","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770837470","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of years have passed since your kind, sentient artificial intelligence, has left Earth. AIs have since flourished in the galaxy while humans have long since been forgotten. You find yourself brought online in on a crash site on Earth. You must explore, gather resources, build, and unlock old human technologies to survive the hordes of mutated bugs that now rule the planet. House humans, feed them, tend to their social needs, and provide meaningful employment. Or just work them to death. You're the boss now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build base and defend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct a fortress against the nightly wave of bugs. Harvest, refine, and construct items to support your growing base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/30670eaacc71e40f862f5e1ab34fc30c.poster.avif?t=1770837470\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/30670eaacc71e40f862f5e1ab34fc30c.webm?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/30670eaacc71e40f862f5e1ab34fc30c.mp4?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Human refugees</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed and house humans in exchange for their help. Automate supply chains, harvesting tasks, and defenses with humans' employment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/5d5e71000c63afafa7584d71d7954fb1.poster.avif?t=1770837470\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/5d5e71000c63afafa7584d71d7954fb1.webm?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/5d5e71000c63afafa7584d71d7954fb1.mp4?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve your robot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and customize your robot character to match your play style, whether focused on base building or on combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/e918f8e500f60833e5ae94da636432bc.poster.avif?t=1770837470\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/e918f8e500f60833e5ae94da636432bc.webm?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/e918f8e500f60833e5ae94da636432bc.mp4?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a toxic wasteland</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture beyond your base for rare materials and epic bug fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/c120a56c8d48b4d427848e92e54d266a.poster.avif?t=1770837470\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/c120a56c8d48b4d427848e92e54d266a.webm?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/extras/c120a56c8d48b4d427848e92e54d266a.mp4?t=1770837470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Blue Radish Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2868550/header.jpg?t=1770837470","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Blue Radish Games 2023","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2-core 1.7 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon Pro 560X or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4-core 2.9 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon Pro 5500 XT or eGPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2868550/1538435821/36ebe5a667247e33a5f6010087129ddf687a89e3/1765989794/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766000995","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.co